WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.766 --> 00:00:05.233
All right, Froakie. Way to go.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.833
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.333
I want you to face the rock and use Bubble.

4
00:00:12.399 --> 00:00:14.833
Froakie!

5
00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:16.933
Awesome. Now use Water Pulse.

6
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.133
Kie! Froakie!

7
00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.200
- Yes!
- Fro!

8
00:00:24.266 --> 00:00:26.966
- You still have much work to do.
- Huh?

9
00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:30.900
Fro? Froakie!

10
00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:34.566
So you've found me, eh?

11
00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:37.100
- Huh?
- Wow. A ninja.

12
00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:39.066
- Na-ha!
- Fro!

13
00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:42.033
Now, Ninja Leaf Shroud.

14
00:00:43.966 --> 00:00:45.900
He's gone.

15
00:00:45.966 --> 00:00:48.866
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

16
00:00:48.933 --> 00:00:52.433
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

17
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.199
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

18
00:00:55.266 --> 00:00:58.199
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

19
00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:01.366
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

20
00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:04.533
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

21
00:01:04.599 --> 00:01:07.966
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

22
00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.733
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

23
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.899
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

24
00:01:12.966 --> 00:01:15.966
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

25
00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:29.266
En route to Cyllage City, where Ash intends to challenge

26
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:31.200
his second Kalos region Gym,

27
00:01:31.266 --> 00:01:35.100
our heroes have encountered a mysterious ninja.

28
00:01:35.166 --> 00:01:37.066
Where could he have gone?

29
00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:39.066
Fro! Froakie!

30
00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:41.100
Use your Frubbles!

31
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:43.933
Good, Froakie. Ugh, let's go.

32
00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:47.600
Huh?

33
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:49.833
Froakie! Fro?

34
00:01:49.899 --> 00:01:53.699
- Frog!
- Who's that Pokémon?

35
00:01:53.766 --> 00:01:56.066
Frogadier. The Bubble Frog Pokémon

36
00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:59.966
and the evolved form of Froakie. Frogadier's speed is unmatched.

37
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:04.266
It can climb a tower over 2,000 feet tall in one minute.

38
00:02:04.333 --> 00:02:06.933
- The evolved form of Froakie?
- Kie!

39
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.866
Frogadier!

40
00:02:09.933 --> 00:02:11.033
Frog!

41
00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.566
-Huh?

42
00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:15.100
- It's so cool.
- Na-na!

43
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:18.033
I am Sanpei, a young and skilful ninja.

44
00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.933
So you're a ninja.

45
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.000
- Incredible.
- Pika!

46
00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:25.299
My name's Ash. You've got a great partner there with Frogadier.

47
00:02:25.366 --> 00:02:27.033
How about a battle with my Froakie?

48
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:31.200
I've been looking for a suitable opponent for my Frogadier to battle against,

49
00:02:31.266 --> 00:02:34.400
but I have my doubts that your Froakie is powerful enough.

50
00:02:34.466 --> 00:02:35.966
- Dier!
- What?

51
00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:37.033
Fro!

52
00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.466
- Won't know until we try, will we?
- Froakie!

53
00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:44.166
- All right, then, I accept your challenge.
- Frog!

54
00:02:44.233 --> 00:02:48.166
- Yeah! Okay, Froakie, let's go.
- Froakie.

55
00:02:49.766 --> 00:02:52.066
The one-on-one battle between Ash

56
00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:55.500
and Sanpei, the young ninja, is about to begin.

57
00:02:55.566 --> 00:02:59.233
The battle will be over when one Pokémon is unable to continue.

58
00:02:59.299 --> 00:03:02.366
- Is that understood?
- Hm!

59
00:03:02.433 --> 00:03:04.433
All right, battle begin.

60
00:03:07.433 --> 00:03:11.799
- You may have the first move, Ash.
- I accept. Froakie, use Bubble.

61
00:03:11.866 --> 00:03:14.100
Froakie!

62
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:16.000
Dodge it.

63
00:03:17.399 --> 00:03:18.433
Frog!

64
00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:19.666
- So fast.
- Pika!

65
00:03:19.733 --> 00:03:21.566
Well, we can move fast, too.

66
00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:25.066
- Now, chase Frogadier and use Pound.
- Froakie!

67
00:03:25.133 --> 00:03:27.000
Frogadier, dodge!

68
00:03:29.566 --> 00:03:30.666
Now, try it again!

69
00:03:30.733 --> 00:03:34.033
- Froakie! Fro!
- Frog!

70
00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:37.533
Frog!

71
00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:42.399
Frogadier's quick. In that case, aim and use Water Pulse, let's go!

72
00:03:42.466 --> 00:03:47.100
Fro... kie!

73
00:03:47.166 --> 00:03:49.299
Now, use Smokescreen.

74
00:03:51.733 --> 00:03:52.766
Huh?

75
00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.166
- Where did Frogadier go?
- Pikachu?

76
00:03:55.233 --> 00:03:58.366
- It's a ninja stealth skill.
- Fro?

77
00:03:58.433 --> 00:04:02.899
Froakie, concentrate. Use your instinct. Water Pulse.

78
00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:08.566
Fro! Froakie!

79
00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.533
- Kie?
- Frog!

80
00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.300
- Huh!
- Now use Bubble.

81
00:04:16.366 --> 00:04:18.700
Frog!

82
00:04:18.766 --> 00:04:24.733
- Counter with Bubble.
- Froakie! Kie!

83
00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.700
- Froakie!
- Fro! Fro!

84
00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:30.300
Water Pulse, let's go.

85
00:04:30.366 --> 00:04:33.300
- Now, you use Water Pulse too.
- Froakie!

86
00:04:37.866 --> 00:04:39.533
- Fro!
- Yeah, way to go.

87
00:04:39.599 --> 00:04:40.599
Awesome.!

88
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:43.966
So is Frogadier stronger because it's the evolved form of Froakie?

89
00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:45.033
Pika! Pika!

90
00:04:45.099 --> 00:04:47.400
Being the evolved form has nothing to do with it.

91
00:04:47.466 --> 00:04:50.599
We're going to win this using our spirit.

92
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.666
- Now, Froakie, Water Pulse.
- Fro!

93
00:04:52.733 --> 00:04:55.566
- Use Quick Attack, go!
- Frog!

94
00:04:55.633 --> 00:04:58.500
-Fro? Fro? Fro? Fro?

95
00:04:58.566 --> 00:05:01.066
- Oh, no.
- I am getting dizzy.

96
00:05:02.633 --> 00:05:05.033
I've never seen a Quick Attack like this before.

97
00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.533
Dodge it, quick!

98
00:05:08.599 --> 00:05:12.500
Froakie!

99
00:05:12.566 --> 00:05:15.400
- You okay?
- This battle is over.

100
00:05:15.466 --> 00:05:18.166
No one has ever withstood my Frogadier's Quick Attack

101
00:05:18.233 --> 00:05:20.433
and been able to continue battling.

102
00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.000
- Frog.
- Fro! Fro!

103
00:05:22.066 --> 00:05:24.433
Huh?

104
00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.233
That's the spirit, Froakie. We're just getting warmed up.

105
00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.333
All right, then use Quick Attack one more time.

106
00:05:31.966 --> 00:05:34.900
Huh! Now, Ninja Leaf Shroud.

107
00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:38.400
Froakie!

108
00:05:38.466 --> 00:05:40.633
- It was already over.
- Huh?

109
00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:43.500
Froakie just wouldn't quit.

110
00:05:44.566 --> 00:05:46.533
Froakie.

111
00:05:46.599 --> 00:05:48.166
Kie. Kie. Fro.

112
00:05:48.233 --> 00:05:51.599
I hate to admit it, but we lost.

113
00:05:56.933 --> 00:05:59.233
Here. Drink this.

114
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.266
We lost because I didn't come up with a good strategy.

115
00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:05.966
I let you down. I'm sorry.

116
00:06:06.033 --> 00:06:07.966
That's exactly correct.

117
00:06:08.033 --> 00:06:09.433
- Huh?
- What was that?

118
00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:13.900
And not only strategy, your Froakie still needs a lot more training.

119
00:06:13.966 --> 00:06:16.666
You completely misread the way our battle progressed

120
00:06:16.733 --> 00:06:19.866
and Froakie trusted its own power far more than it should have.

121
00:06:19.933 --> 00:06:23.599
You were fortunate Froakie didn't take more damage than it did.

122
00:06:23.666 --> 00:06:28.466
Dier.

123
00:06:28.533 --> 00:06:30.466
- Here.
- What's that?

124
00:06:30.533 --> 00:06:33.633
It's a remedy that's been formulated using Energy Root.

125
00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.633
It will replenish Froakie's energy.

126
00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:44.066
When a medicine is bitter, you can be quite sure that it's going to work.

127
00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:45.799
-Froakie! Froakie!

128
00:06:45.866 --> 00:06:47.866
Wow, Froakie's looking better already.

129
00:06:47.933 --> 00:06:51.066
- Well, it's time for us to leave.
- Adier.

130
00:06:51.133 --> 00:06:54.966
- Hey, wait a minute.
- Hm? Something else I can do for you?

131
00:06:55.033 --> 00:06:58.166
- Please. Show me how you did it.
- Did what?

132
00:06:58.233 --> 00:06:59.333
Huh?

133
00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.299
In all the time I've been training,

134
00:07:01.366 --> 00:07:05.133
I've never seen a Quick Attack as amazing as the one Frogadier used in battle.

135
00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.500
So please teach my Froakie how to use it like that.

136
00:07:08.566 --> 00:07:10.599
You want to learn how to do it, don't you?

137
00:07:10.666 --> 00:07:14.166
- Kie.
- Won't you help us?

138
00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:16.533
Kie!

139
00:07:16.599 --> 00:07:19.066
Hmm? All right.

140
00:07:19.133 --> 00:07:21.633
- Ah! You're not kidding?
- No way.

141
00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:25.066
- Yeah! Isn't that great, Froakie?
- Froakie.

142
00:07:25.133 --> 00:07:28.033
But my training methods are very strict.

143
00:07:28.099 --> 00:07:30.866
- That's just fine with us. Okay, Froakie?
- Fro.

144
00:07:30.933 --> 00:07:33.233
Watching this is such amazing stuff.

145
00:07:33.299 --> 00:07:35.766
Two Trainers can be part of a really tough battle

146
00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:37.866
and then be friends once their battle's over.

147
00:07:37.933 --> 00:07:39.966
That's what a Pokémon battle's all about.

148
00:07:40.033 --> 00:07:42.200
So you know, when I train a Pokémon,

149
00:07:42.266 --> 00:07:44.866
I train them hard and I train hard along with them.

150
00:07:44.933 --> 00:07:48.500
Yeah, I'm right with you. I'll train hard right along with Froakie.

151
00:07:48.566 --> 00:07:52.466
- I want to be a ninja too.
- Then, Bonnie, just leave it to me.

152
00:07:53.466 --> 00:07:55.633
- Pikachu!
- Ne! Ne!

153
00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.233
I'm a ninja.

154
00:07:58.299 --> 00:08:01.066
Awesome, Bonnie. You really look the part.

155
00:08:01.133 --> 00:08:02.500
Thanks.

156
00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.633
The important thing about Quick Attack is, of course, to be able to move quickly

157
00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.833
and to do that, one must develop springy and flexible muscles,

158
00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:21.200
so the first thing we need to do is work on strengthening your spring.

159
00:08:21.266 --> 00:08:23.733
Hm, I'd say it's time for me to step up.

160
00:08:23.799 --> 00:08:28.500
You'd better prepare yourselves for this. Clemontic gear on!

161
00:08:28.566 --> 00:08:31.933
I call this my Muscle Mass Magnifying Machine.

162
00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.366
I thought we'd encounter a situation precisely like this one.

163
00:08:35.433 --> 00:08:39.433
Uh, okay. So you put springs on your shoes.

164
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.033
Ah, but they're not normal springs.

165
00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:44.966
The basis of all exercise is increasing muscle strength.

166
00:08:45.033 --> 00:08:48.733
The springs I've equipped in these shoes multiply the power of your jumping

167
00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:51.100
by using your body weight in the process.

168
00:08:51.166 --> 00:08:53.400
Because of the added load of your body weight,

169
00:08:53.466 --> 00:08:55.400
they strengthen your leg muscles rapidly.

170
00:08:55.466 --> 00:08:58.133
Wow! Science is so amazing.

171
00:08:58.199 --> 00:09:00.699
Allow me to show you how it works.

172
00:09:00.766 --> 00:09:04.199
Argh!

173
00:09:04.266 --> 00:09:07.300
Well, he disappeared really fast, no doubt.

174
00:09:10.033 --> 00:09:12.199
Huh? Huh? Camouflage skill.

175
00:09:12.266 --> 00:09:16.066
- Na-na-na?
- Pika? Pika? Pika!

176
00:09:16.133 --> 00:09:18.766
Training must proceed step by step.

177
00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:22.966
Frogadier, please demonstrate for them our basic training method.

178
00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:28.333
Frogadier! Frogadier!

179
00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:30.033
- So quick.
- Fro.

180
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.233
All right, Froakie, do you think you can keep up with Frogadier?

181
00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.933
- Froakie.
- There's no better time

182
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.933
- for you to give it a try.
- Fro!

183
00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.933
Froakie! Froakie! Fro!

184
00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.366
I am always one with my Pokémon. Always.

185
00:09:44.566 --> 00:09:48.033
- Yeah, me too.
- Wow! Yeah, me too.

186
00:09:49.766 --> 00:09:53.400
You're not jumping fast enough!

187
00:09:53.466 --> 00:09:55.133
- Keep it up, Froakie.
- Fro!

188
00:09:55.199 --> 00:09:58.633
- You're still jumping too slowly.
- How about this?

189
00:09:58.699 --> 00:10:00.000
Fro! Fro! Fro!

190
00:10:00.066 --> 00:10:02.000
Faster!

191
00:10:03.466 --> 00:10:06.966
I can't do any more! Argh!

192
00:10:07.033 --> 00:10:08.900
- Pikachu.
- Na-na-na!

193
00:10:10.966 --> 00:10:13.833
- Fro! Fro!
- Excellent.

194
00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.400
It looks like Froakie's beginning to move just as fast as Frogadier is.

195
00:10:17.466 --> 00:10:19.900
Keep up the pace, you're getting there!

196
00:10:19.966 --> 00:10:21.900
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

197
00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:25.000
That was well done! Time for the next step.

198
00:10:26.266 --> 00:10:28.933
Ninja stealth skill.

199
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.699
Next, we'll teach Froakie to run over water.

200
00:10:31.766 --> 00:10:33.100
Huh? On water?

201
00:10:33.166 --> 00:10:36.366
But running on water is scientifically impossible.

202
00:10:36.433 --> 00:10:38.100
Nah, we can do it.

203
00:10:38.166 --> 00:10:40.699
All right, Frogadier will show you how it's done.

204
00:10:40.766 --> 00:10:46.133
Frog! Frog! Frogadier!

205
00:10:46.199 --> 00:10:49.766
I can't believe Frogadier really ran on water.

206
00:10:49.833 --> 00:10:52.133
Froakie. Now it's your turn to show them.

207
00:10:52.199 --> 00:10:54.166
- Froakie!
- Froakie, you can do it!

208
00:10:54.233 --> 00:10:56.333
Fro! Fro! Fro...

209
00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:58.866
Ugh!

210
00:11:00.266 --> 00:11:01.833
Okay, now it's my turn.

211
00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:05.533
-Oh, no, Ash.

212
00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.600
- Are you okay?
- Pika! Pi!

213
00:11:07.666 --> 00:11:09.766
Unh! No good. Can't do it.

214
00:11:09.833 --> 00:11:12.366
Naturally it's impossible for me as well!

215
00:11:12.433 --> 00:11:15.933
Huh? Why didn't you tell me that?

216
00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.300
The trick to being able to run over water is

217
00:11:18.366 --> 00:11:20.366
to make sure you move your feet quickly.

218
00:11:20.433 --> 00:11:23.933
Move your feet quickly. Can you do that, Froakie?

219
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:28.433
- Froakie?
- Yeah, like that! Go!

220
00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.933
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro...

221
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.133
Froakie, no!

222
00:11:35.066 --> 00:11:37.066
- Fro!
- Okay, try it again!

223
00:11:37.133 --> 00:11:40.033
Fro! Fro! Fro! Froakie! Kie!

224
00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:44.500
- You can do it, Froakie!
- Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

225
00:11:44.566 --> 00:11:48.066
- Show them how it's done, Froakie!
- Frogadier! Dier! Dier!

226
00:11:49.466 --> 00:11:53.900
Frog! Frogadier!

227
00:11:53.966 --> 00:11:56.433
- Kie... Fro!
- Feeling frustrated?

228
00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.766
Then use all that frustration and get out there! Do it!

229
00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:05.933
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Kie!

230
00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.933
- You did it!
- Pika! Pika!

231
00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:11.433
- Froakie. Froakie. Froakie. Froakie.
- Frogadier!

232
00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.266
Fro?

233
00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.966
That Frogadier is something else.

234
00:12:17.033 --> 00:12:21.266
Team Rocket ninjas. Great! No, wait. Team Rocket ninja Pokémon.

235
00:12:21.333 --> 00:12:23.500
We'll put together a ninja Pokémon posse

236
00:12:23.566 --> 00:12:25.666
and Froakie and Frogadier will be the stars!

237
00:12:25.733 --> 00:12:27.966
Wobbuffet!

238
00:12:28.033 --> 00:12:31.033
Who's that Pokémon?

239
00:12:35.033 --> 00:12:37.333
It's Frogadier!

240
00:12:41.033 --> 00:12:44.599
Okay, Sanpei, what kind of training do we do next?

241
00:12:44.666 --> 00:12:46.566
Now, let me think.

242
00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:50.133
-No! I'm as embarrassed as I can be.

243
00:12:50.199 --> 00:12:54.166
That's nothing a little lunch can't fix and I'll take care of the cooking!

244
00:12:54.233 --> 00:12:57.566
- And I'll make the dessert.
- It's ninja lunchtime!

245
00:12:57.633 --> 00:13:01.166
- All right!
- Let's eat! Hey, thanks!

246
00:13:04.699 --> 00:13:07.000
Wow! This is great! Delish!

247
00:13:07.066 --> 00:13:10.066
- What is it?
- You're eating fried noodles.

248
00:13:10.133 --> 00:13:13.966
It's now my favorite food! I'd heard of it from my friends in Ninja Village.

249
00:13:14.033 --> 00:13:16.566
It's so good!

250
00:13:16.633 --> 00:13:19.766
- Please try the cookies I baked too!
- Hmm.

251
00:13:22.633 --> 00:13:24.800
This is the best cookie ever!

252
00:13:26.966 --> 00:13:29.866
There's nothing like a nap after a good meal.

253
00:13:29.933 --> 00:13:31.900
For sure!

254
00:13:31.966 --> 00:13:36.900
So, Sanpei, that Ninja Village you mentioned, is that your hometown?

255
00:13:36.966 --> 00:13:40.666
That's right. It's also the home of my oldest brother, Ippei,

256
00:13:40.733 --> 00:13:43.199
who is by far the strongest man in Ninja Village.

257
00:13:43.266 --> 00:13:44.900
He's there with his Greninja.

258
00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.033
- Greninja?
- The final evolution of Froakie.

259
00:13:49.099 --> 00:13:51.099
And there's my other brother Nihei,

260
00:13:51.166 --> 00:13:54.300
who lives in Ninja Village as well, with his Venusaur.

261
00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.900
So there's Ippei, there's Nihei and there's Sanpei.

262
00:14:00.599 --> 00:14:03.500
My ultimate goal is to one day defeat both of my brothers

263
00:14:03.566 --> 00:14:07.533
and assume the title of strongest ninja in Ninja Village once and for all.

264
00:14:07.599 --> 00:14:10.733
So I guess you left Ninja Village so you could train, right?

265
00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.966
Exactly. What about you, Ash?

266
00:14:13.033 --> 00:14:15.966
I'm working hard to one day become a Pokémon Master!

267
00:14:16.033 --> 00:14:17.533
Oh.

268
00:14:17.599 --> 00:14:20.300
It's incredible how even though your goals are different,

269
00:14:20.366 --> 00:14:23.500
you're both working as hard as you can to realize your dreams!

270
00:14:23.566 --> 00:14:25.533
Sounds like you make good rivals!

271
00:14:30.866 --> 00:14:35.266
-Pika! Pika! Pikachu!

272
00:14:35.333 --> 00:14:38.500
Next we'll train by jumping from tree branch to tree branch

273
00:14:38.566 --> 00:14:41.033
in order to get the kind of explosive power one needs

274
00:14:41.099 --> 00:14:43.400
to execute an exceptional Quick Attack.

275
00:14:43.466 --> 00:14:46.966
All right, then, Ash and Froakie, you follow Frogadier and me!

276
00:14:47.033 --> 00:14:49.966
Froakie, this is where we really need to step on the gas!

277
00:14:50.033 --> 00:14:51.300
Then, let's go!

278
00:14:51.366 --> 00:14:53.666
-Frog!

279
00:14:53.733 --> 00:14:57.000
- Fro! Fro!
- Yeah! Wah!

280
00:14:58.166 --> 00:15:02.066
Always look two or three branches ahead! You'll go faster!

281
00:15:02.133 --> 00:15:06.033
Once you get the hang of it, you won't believe your speed!

282
00:15:06.099 --> 00:15:09.400
Wow, Froakie! You've gotten a lot faster!

283
00:15:11.366 --> 00:15:14.699
- Yeah, keep it up, Froakie!
- Froakie.

284
00:15:23.666 --> 00:15:26.333
- Are you two all right?
- Yeah!

285
00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.933
Remember, you need to act with complete awareness

286
00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:30.633
of your surroundings at all times!

287
00:15:30.699 --> 00:15:34.066
- I'll do that! Thanks a lot!
- Froakie!

288
00:15:35.166 --> 00:15:37.699
Now, Ninja Leaf Shroud!

289
00:15:37.766 --> 00:15:41.566
Pika. Pikachu. Pika. Pikachu.

290
00:15:41.633 --> 00:15:44.366
And next up, we finally work on our Quick Attack!

291
00:15:44.433 --> 00:15:46.966
Hear that? We're ready to go!

292
00:15:47.033 --> 00:15:49.866
All right, Frogadier, show them how it's done.

293
00:15:49.933 --> 00:15:51.866
Now use Quick Attack!

294
00:15:51.933 --> 00:15:56.000
Frog! Frog!

295
00:15:56.066 --> 00:15:59.199
I get it. Quick Attack generates so much power

296
00:15:59.266 --> 00:16:01.333
because it's done with so much speed!

297
00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:05.199
Yeah! Frogadier's Quick Attack is as awesome as I've seen!

298
00:16:05.266 --> 00:16:06.766
- Wow!
- Pikachu.

299
00:16:06.833 --> 00:16:08.833
- Now, why don't you give it a try?
- Right!

300
00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.333
Okay, Froakie, Quick Attack, let's go!

301
00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:17.666
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Froakie! Fro

302
00:16:18.733 --> 00:16:21.666
Froakie's form is correct, but it still moves too slowly.

303
00:16:21.733 --> 00:16:22.900
Okay, one more time!

304
00:16:22.966 --> 00:16:24.300
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

305
00:16:24.366 --> 00:16:26.300
You've got to move your feet with more speed!

306
00:16:26.366 --> 00:16:27.800
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

307
00:16:27.866 --> 00:16:29.366
Keep thinking of your next move!

308
00:16:29.433 --> 00:16:32.433
Froakie!

309
00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.166
We're almost there!

310
00:16:37.233 --> 00:16:40.166
But I still wouldn't call what Froakie's doing a Quick Attack.

311
00:16:40.233 --> 00:16:44.900
- Frogadier.
- Froakie?

312
00:16:44.966 --> 00:16:46.266
Hold on, what's that?

313
00:16:46.333 --> 00:16:48.800
Prepare for trouble! Hold on for dear life!

314
00:16:48.866 --> 00:16:50.766
And make it double, the fury and strife!

315
00:16:50.833 --> 00:16:52.666
To protect the world from devastation!

316
00:16:52.733 --> 00:16:54.500
To unite all people within our nation!

317
00:16:54.566 --> 00:16:56.466
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

318
00:16:56.533 --> 00:16:58.766
To extend our reach to the stars above!

319
00:16:58.833 --> 00:17:01.333
- Jessie!
- And it's James!

320
00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:04.800
Team Rocket stealthily blasts off at the speed of light!

321
00:17:04.866 --> 00:17:07.333
Surrender now or prepare for one ninja-esque fight!

322
00:17:07.399 --> 00:17:10.333
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

323
00:17:10.399 --> 00:17:11.700
Team Rocket!

324
00:17:11.766 --> 00:17:13.433
- Pika!
- Who are they?

325
00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.333
They're really bad guys who steal other people's Pokémon!

326
00:17:16.399 --> 00:17:17.599
It's a gift!

327
00:17:17.666 --> 00:17:21.333
Now we're going to add Froakie and Frogadier to our evil Pokémon ranks!

328
00:17:21.399 --> 00:17:24.766
We'll catch 'em right now, then the Boss will say thanks!

329
00:17:29.566 --> 00:17:31.766
Oh, yeah!

330
00:17:35.399 --> 00:17:40.399
- Frogadier, Frubbles!
- Frogadier!

331
00:17:40.466 --> 00:17:41.899
My hair's frosted!

332
00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:45.633
All right Ash, Froakie and Frogadier need to put their strength together!

333
00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:48.833
- So that's what we'll do!
- Hmm. Well, I prefer apart!

334
00:17:48.899 --> 00:17:50.833
- Separate them!
- Don't sweat it!

335
00:17:50.899 --> 00:17:53.766
You got to keep ‘em separated!

336
00:17:53.833 --> 00:17:57.966
- Quick Attack, let's go!
- Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

337
00:17:58.033 --> 00:17:59.033
Fro!

338
00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:01.266
Froakie, no! Frog?

339
00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.033
Feet don't fail me now!

340
00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.033
Okay! Net!

341
00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.033
-Fro!

342
00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.066
- Frogadier!
- Oh, hear, hear!

343
00:18:13.133 --> 00:18:14.600
Pikachu, use Iron Tail!

344
00:18:14.666 --> 00:18:18.666
Pikachu! Chu!

345
00:18:18.733 --> 00:18:21.266
More net!

346
00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:23.266
Pikachu, too!

347
00:18:23.333 --> 00:18:26.833
- Oh, you're a crack shot!
- Catching three Pokémon hits the spot!

348
00:18:26.899 --> 00:18:31.366
- No way! Froakie, Quick Attack, once more!
- Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

349
00:18:31.433 --> 00:18:35.933
The only way you could dodge these is not be here! Ha!

350
00:18:37.133 --> 00:18:39.800
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

351
00:18:45.366 --> 00:18:50.100
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

352
00:18:50.166 --> 00:18:51.566
- Huh?
- What's going on?

353
00:18:51.633 --> 00:18:55.533
- Froakie's using Double Team!
- Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

354
00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:58.033
I don't want to play Pick the Real Pokémon!

355
00:18:58.100 --> 00:18:59.633
Now Water Pulse!

356
00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:02.399
Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro! Fro!

357
00:19:02.466 --> 00:19:05.966
Fro! Fro!

358
00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:11.266
- Wow, Froakie did it!
- Okay! Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

359
00:19:11.333 --> 00:19:15.000
Pikachu!

360
00:19:17.433 --> 00:19:19.433
- Let's wrap this up!
- Okay!

361
00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:20.866
Use Water Pulse, now!

362
00:19:20.933 --> 00:19:26.500
Froakie!

363
00:19:28.166 --> 00:19:31.966
We're blasting off again!

364
00:19:32.033 --> 00:19:34.399
Wobbuffet!

365
00:19:34.466 --> 00:19:35.800
Yeah!

366
00:19:35.866 --> 00:19:39.000
- Froakie and Pikachu, you're safe!
- Pika!

367
00:19:39.066 --> 00:19:42.566
- Amazing! You were great, Frogadier!
- Frog.

368
00:19:44.899 --> 00:19:50.399
Frogadier, I think we owe them a debt of gratitude for all they did for us.

369
00:19:50.466 --> 00:19:52.566
We're the ones who should thank you.

370
00:19:52.633 --> 00:19:55.100
You're the reason Froakie learned to use Double Team.

371
00:19:55.166 --> 00:19:57.633
Thanks so much for all the great training!

372
00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.833
Ash, that was as amazing a Double Team as any I've ever seen

373
00:20:00.899 --> 00:20:02.733
either of my brothers' Pokémon use!

374
00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:07.733
Thanks, although it really started out as a Quick Attack, but I guess that's okay.

375
00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.700
Froakie's Double Team should be very useful from here on out.

376
00:20:10.766 --> 00:20:12.766
It gives you another move to use in battles!

377
00:20:12.833 --> 00:20:14.733
- And it's totally cool!
- Na-ma!

378
00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:18.899
Okay, we're off. Let's battle again next time we meet, okay?

379
00:20:18.966 --> 00:20:20.200
Pika. Pika.

380
00:20:20.266 --> 00:20:23.733
- You got yourself a deal!
- Take care!

381
00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:25.866
- See you!
- Bye!

382
00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:28.233
- Be good!
- Na-ha!

383
00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.966
Farewell, everyone!

384
00:20:30.033 --> 00:20:32.966
- Kie! Kie! Fro! Fro!
- Frog

385
00:20:33.033 --> 00:20:35.866
Thanks to the guidance of Sanpei and Frogadier,

386
00:20:35.933 --> 00:20:37.866
Froakie has honed its Quick Attack skills

387
00:20:37.933 --> 00:20:40.466
and learned how to use Double Team as well!

388
00:20:40.533 --> 00:20:42.633
Now, after promises to meet again,

389
00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.533
our heroes are back on the road,

390
00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:47.433
as the journey continues!
